The instant petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India has been filed seeking the following reliefs:
Neutral Citation Number: 2023:DHC:4948-DB a) That this Hon'ble Court be pleased to issue a writ, order or directions in the nature of certiorari thereby quashing the Demarcation Report dated 23.04.2022 qua the Petitioners property;
b) That this Hon 'ble Court be pleased to issue a writ, order or directions in the nature of certiorari quashing the impugned Notice bearing F. No. SDM/ HK/
Demarcation/Kharera402/(2018)/2020/738 dated 22.06.2022 issued by Respondent No. I qua the Petitioners' property;
c) That this Hon'ble Court be pleased to issue a writ, order or directions in the nature of mandamus thereby directing the Respondent No. I to not to proceed with the demarcation during the pendency andfinal disposal of the present Writ Petition;
Kamaljeet Bajwa & Ors. vs Government Of Nct Of Delhi & Ors. on 18 July, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/67386936/
24 d) For cost of the Petition and;
e) For such other and further reliefs as the nature and circumstances, as the case may require.
